IN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터(연계전공)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #000066; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">그린에너지 관련분야</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"73\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #ece9d8 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"171\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">산업체 경력자 우대</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #008080; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">2. 응모자격<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교육공무원 임용에 결격사유가 없는 자.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 산업체 경력자 우대</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 초빙분야의 박사학위 소지자 우대.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #008080\">3. 임용예정일</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">▶ 2011. 8. 1.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> &nbsp;</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #008080\">&nbsp;4. 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;가.&nbsp;계약교원신규채용 지원서(본교 소정양식) 1부.<br><br></span>&nbsp; 나. 이력서(본교 소정양식) 1부.</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학력 및 성적증명서(학사, 석사, 박사) 원본 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (외국대학에서 학위를 취득한 경우는 학위증 사본과 본인이 날인한 국문 번역본 제출) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 경력증명서(이력서에 기재된 모든 경력) 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 외국어로 된 증명서는 본인이 날인한 번역문을 첨부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 국외경력은 주한 해당국 공관이나 주재국 한국공관에서 공증을 받은 것에 한함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 부득이 사본을 제출한 경우에는 원본과 대조할 수 있도록 원본을 지참하여 확인을 받고, 본인이 서명한 후 제출.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 재직증명서(해당자에 한하며, 재직기간이 명시된 것) 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 석사 및 박사학위논문(기간 제한 없음) 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 연구실적물[최근 4년이내(’07.7.19 ~ ’11.7.18) 실적물에 한하여 원본 또는 별쇄본] 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;아. 자기소개서(A4용지 2장 이내, 서식 제한 없음) 1부.<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\">《소정양식은 첨부 화일을 다운받아 한글로 작성하시어 제출하시기 바람≫</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #008080; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;5. 지원서 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 7. 14.(목) ~ 7. 18.(월)&nbsp; 09:00 ~ 18:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수방법 및 접수처</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 방문접수 : 본교 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터(그린에너지관 401호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 우편접수 : 730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;그린에너지시스템인재양성센터(기한 내 도착분에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ 본인 외 대리접수 가능, 우편접수 시 반드시 전화로 접수상태 확인할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #008080; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;6. 기타</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본 공고에 명시되지 않은 사항은 교육공무원법 등 관계 법령 및 본교 인사관련 규정에 의함.</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 시 구비서류가 미비 또는 기한 내 도착하지 않을 경우 접수하지 않음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 심사 후&nbsp;면접대상자는 개별 통지함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 계약 기간 : 2011. 8. 1. ~ 2012. 2. 29</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 적격자가 없을 경우 초빙하지 않을 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 기타 상세한 사항은 본교 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 행정지원팀으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 전화 : (054)478-7947 / 팩스 : (054)478-7934</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 홈페이지 : </span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> , </span><a href=\"http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://gec.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
